{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ashrei","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n78.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"84"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/84/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Fortunate are they that dwell in Thine House, they will still praise Thee, Selah. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"144"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ashrei/quoted_144_15","n":"15"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/144/15"}}
{"text":"Fortunate the people to whom this happens, fortunate the people whose God is the Lord."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"145","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Hymn by David "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"text":"I exalt Thee, my God and King, and bless Thy Name for ever and ever. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Every day do I bless Thee and praise Thy Name for ever and ever. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Great is the Lord and highly to be praised, His greatness is unfathomable. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Generation shall praise Thy works to generation and they shall tell of Thy mighty deeds. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The beauty of the glory of Thy majesty and "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n80.jpg","n":"25"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"words about Thy wonders shall I utter. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Men shall speak of the strength of Thine awe-inspiring deeds and, as for Thy greatness, let me relate it. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The fame of the abundance of Thy goodness do they express and exult in Thy righteousness. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Gracious and compassionate is the Lord, long suffering and great in kindness. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Benevolent is the Lord towards all and His compassion is upon all His creatures. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"All Thy works acknowledge Thee, O Lord, and Thy pious ones bless Thee. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"They speak of the glory of Thy dominion and tell of Thy might "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/12","n":"12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"to make known to the sons of man His mighty deeds and the glory of the beauty of His dominion. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/13","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Thy kingdom is an everlasting kingdom and Thy dominion is in every generation. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/14","n":"14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The Lord supports all that fall and straightens all that are bent. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/15","n":"15"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"All eyes hope for Thee and Thou givest them their food in its time. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/16","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Thou openest Thy hands and satisfiest all the living in favour. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/17","n":"17"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Righteous is the Lord in all His ways and pious in all His deeds. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/18","n":"18"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The Lord is near all who call Him, all who call Him in truth. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/19","n":"19"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The desire of those that fear Him does He do and He hears their cry and saves them. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/20","n":"20"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The Lord protects all that love Him and destroys all the wicked. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/145/21","n":"21"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The fame of the Lord does my mouth declare and all flesh shall bless His holy Name for ever and ever. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"115"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/115/18","n":"18"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"We too shall bless the Lord from now to eternity. Halleluyah. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
